{"id":"5b57b2e83882e1d8","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-pushout.md","title":"Pushout","display":"df-pushout — Pushout","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-pushout","aliases":["93-df-pushout"],"display":"df-pushout — Pushout","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-pushout"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-pushout</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pushout — Pushout"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(A,B,C,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,C)\">\\(g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,C)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,P)\">\\(i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,P)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,P)\">\\(j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,P)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pushout}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pushout}_{93}\\)</span> (pushout predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\\)</span> (morphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushout}\\vdash \\mathrm{Pushout}_{93}(P,i,j,f,g,A,B,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,C,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,A,C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(i,B,P,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(j,C,P,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land i\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=j\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,Q)\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\to\n\\exists!w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Q)\\;\n\\bigl(w\\circ_{\\mathcal C}i=u\\land w\\circ_{\\mathcal C}j=v\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushout}\\vdash \\mathrm{Pushout}_{93}(P,i,j,f,g,A,B,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,C,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,A,C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(i,B,P,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(j,C,P,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land i\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=j\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Q\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,Q)\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\to\n\\exists!w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Q)\\;\n\\bigl(w\\circ_{\\mathcal C}i=u\\land w\\circ_{\\mathcal C}j=v\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Pushouts are used in the amalgamation-property definition. Every object, arrow, and composition is typed in the same category <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)$ (see [[93-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ (morphism predicate, see [[93-df-morphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B,C,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,C)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,P)","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pushout}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pushout}\\vdash \\mathrm{Pushout}_{93}(P,i,j,f,g,A,B,C,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,C,P\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(f,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(g,A,C,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(i,B,P,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(j,C,P,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land i\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=j\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Q\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall u\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,Q)\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,Q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl(u\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=v\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\to\n\\exists!w\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(P,Q)\\;\n\\bigl(w\\circ_{\\mathcal C}i=u\\land w\\circ_{\\mathcal C}j=v\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","b3500ab2f8429ba4"]}